  <h1>A 3D home from a street address</h1>
  <p class="meta">19 November 2026</p>
  <p class="appears">Appears in <a href="/projects/home-3d/">Home 3D</a></p>

  <p>Placeholder copy. Your draft goes here. The idea: type in an address, and get back a 3D model of the house good enough to plan a remodel on. Everything comes from public data, and most of it was already sitting in the listing.</p>

